  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {普及|ふきゅう}する - to spread, become widespread (intransitive)\n- {普及|ふきゅう}させる - to disseminate, popularize (transitive/causative)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {急速|きゅうそく}に{普及|ふきゅう}する - to spread rapidly\n- {広|ひろ}く{普及|ふきゅう}している - to be widely used\n- {普及|ふきゅう}{率|りつ} - penetration rate, adoption rate\n- {普及|ふきゅう}{活動|かつどう} - promotional activities\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {浸透|しんとう} - permeation (more gradual, deeper adoption)\n- {拡大|かくだい} - expansion\n- {流行|りゅうこう} - trend, being in fashion",
